{"id":"n68412-2-7","stage":5,"title":"영양가 · 营养价值","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68412-2-7-1","ko":"저도 알고 있으니 잔소리는 그만하세요.","zh":"我也知道，您别再唠叨了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저도","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알고","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잔소리는","meaning":"啰嗦，唠叨，絮叨","explanation":"잔소리：啰嗦，唠叨，絮叨；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"잔소리","audio":"/audio/ea11cfb0d47f7e6510b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77876","senseId":"2","lemma":"잔소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그만하세요.","meaning":"停止，停","explanation":"그만하다：停止，停；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"그만하다","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37072","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ea11cfb0d47f7e65","term":"잔소리","zh":"啰嗦，唠叨，絮叨","audio":"/audio/ea11cfb0d47f7e6510b2.mp3","entryId":"77876","definition":"教训干涉、反复地说不好听的话；或指该话。","pronunciation":["잔소리"]},{"id":"129344a9c4625793","term":"그만하다","zh":"停止，停","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3","entryId":"37072","definition":"停住正在做的事。","pronunciation":["그만하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd5b690f293724036ca4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68412-2-7-2","ko":"듣기 싫은 말이 영양가가 좋은 법이다.","zh":"不爱听的话往往才对你有益。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"듣기","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싫은","meaning":"讨厌","explanation":"싫다：讨厌；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영양가가","meaning":"营养价值","explanation":"영양가：营养价值；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영양가","audio":"/audio/b4f7237222005590f118.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68412","senseId":"2","lemma":"영양가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"법이다.","meaning":"表示理所当然。","explanation":"법：表示理所当然。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"법","audio":"/audio/bc47fef03a447a939586.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62407","senseId":"5","lemma":"법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"讨厌","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不中意。","pronunciation":["실타"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"b4f7237222005590","term":"영양가","zh":"营养价值","audio":"/audio/b4f7237222005590f118.mp3","entryId":"68412","definition":"(喻义)意义或利益。","pronunciation":["영양까"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"bc47fef03a447a93","term":"법","zh":"表示理所当然。","audio":"/audio/bc47fef03a447a939586.mp3","entryId":"62407","definition":"表示理所当然。","pronunciation":["법"]}],"audio":"/audio/20facd519d5034a6d336.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.273,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68412","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":156,"sequenceScore":3.0997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我也知道，您别再唠叨了。","不爱听的话往往才对你有益。","裕敏啊，这次长跑比赛你的目标是什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我也知道，您别再唠叨了。","不爱听的话往往才对你有益。","裕敏啊，这次长跑比赛你的目标是什么？"],"answer":1}]}
